# Author order: the byline of the paper.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproduction package, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Toward Hardware-Grounded Energy Estimation for KWOK: Calibrating Simulated Kubernetes Nodes Against RAPL and NVML (reproduction package)"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package of the paper "Toward Hardware-Grounded Energy Estimation for KWOK":
  the energy layer for KWOK (per-component model, exporter, trace replay), the measurement
  harness, the live KWOK experiment, the dataset of both capture sessions (RAPL and NVML
  traces of 20 workloads x 5 repetitions on two multi-GPU servers) and a Docker environment
  that regenerates every number and table of the paper from the dataset.
type: software
